---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How LUMÈRA LUXE handles your data, respects your privacy, and safeguards your personal correspondence."
  intro="How we handle your information when you browse, use your shopping bag, or contact us on WhatsApp."
  links={[
    { id: 'your-privacy', label: 'Your privacy' },
    { id: 'shopping-bag', label: 'Shopping bag' },
    { id: 'whatsapp', label: 'WhatsApp' }
  ]}
  contact={{
    title: "Questions about privacy?",
    text: "Contact us with privacy questions or to request deletion of past communication records.",
    email: siteConfig.email
  }}
>
  <section id="your-privacy">
    <h2>How we handle your information</h2>
    <p>
      At LUMÈRA LUXE, personal privacy is an essential tenet of luxury. Our digital boutique is engineered on a privacy-first architecture, purposely avoiding invasive user trackers, data brokers, or advertising pixels.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="shopping-bag">
    <h2>Information saved in your browser</h2>
    <p>
      When you add perfumes to your shopping bag, details are stored locally in your browser's private local storage (<code>localStorage</code>). We do not record or store financial payment details, banking credentials, or personal profiles on remote marketing servers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="whatsapp">
    <h2>WhatsApp messages</h2>
    <p>
      When you initiate an order inquiry via WhatsApp, your product selections and notes are transmitted directly into your personal WhatsApp application. Your communication is shielded by WhatsApp's end-to-end encryption.
    </p>
    <p>
      We use your correspondence exclusively to verify inventory, calculate transparent courier rates, and deliver your parcel in Qatar. We never commercialize or share client phone numbers with third-party advertisers.
    </p>
  </section>
</PolicyLayout>
